    {
      "doc_id": "ai-evals-m05",
      "section_id": "choosing-the-automation-method-code-based-vs-llm-as-judge",
      "quote": "The default path should always be code-based evaluation because it's faster, cheaper, and 100% reproducible (deterministic)... Only when a metric requires subjective nuance should you consider moving to the more complex LLM-as-Judge approach."
